## Other machine rules

- On Windows use `& {{ $windowsEnv }}/Invoke-WinOpen.ps1 <TARGET>`.
  From WSL or Git Bash use `bash {{ $windowsEnv }}/win-open <TARGET>`, not `xdg-open`.
- USB devices require Windows-side `usbipd attach` before WSL can see them.
